Z||000006||Phil||07-01-2001||11:10 AM||||Got everything up and running and did some experimenting, the verticle 2 wire sensor in the head doesn't appear to be the fan switch.  I let the car heat up 'til the fan came (220 according the the temp gage) then disconnected the plug from the sensor in question and the fan kept running. I think I remember hearing that the fan on 88's is computer controlled. Darned 4 bangers. Maybe somebody with a 22p could look it up.||||reg||1
